# The claim the whole spectral pipeline exists to make, scrubbed live: drag a
# luminaire's COLOUR TEMP and the lumens do not move, because they are what
# was authored -- the WATTS move instead, and so does efficacy, and so does
# the colour of the render.
wait 5000
key Tab                     # the first luminaire
key V
key V                       # SIMPLE -> ADVANCED -> SCIENTIFIC
wait 1500

record inspector 160
wait 800
# The scrub is multiplicative (1.012 per pixel), so these two are 5000 K down
# to about 2700 and back up past 6000 -- the range the README quotes.
drag 1200 388 1148 388 1800 # COLOUR TEMP row, dragged warm
wait 2800
drag 1148 388 1222 388 1800 # and back up, past where it started
wait 3200
stop
